    "Application procedure | Univerzita Pardubice\nSkip to main content\nApplication procedure\nWelcome to our Application procedure\nAre you a mobility coordinator at our partner university? Get more information about the deadlines, processes and online nominations under\n\"Mobility Coordinator Info\"\n.\nAre you a future exchange student of the University of Pardubice? Get more information about how to apply under the link\n\"Student Info\"\n.\nShould you have other questions feel free to contact us:\nMs. Martina Votoupalová\nmartina.votoupalova@upce.cz\nmobility@upce.cz\nUniversity of Pardubice\nMap\nContacts\n​\nContacts\nFaculties and Central Services and Facilites\nPanoramic view\nExchange/Erasmus+\nInternational students\nMagazine MY UPCE\nWebsite feedback\nServices\nAccommodation\nLibrary\nDepartment of Physical Education and Sports\nNostrification\nE-shop\nThe Centre for Technology  and Knowledge Transfer\nLanguage Centre\nGuidebook for Internationals\nEuropean University Alliance\n© 2023\nUniversity of Pardubice\n,\nStudentská 95\n,\n532 10\nPardubice 2\nPhone:\n+420 466 036 111, 466 036 112, 466 036 113\nWebmaster\n,\nRSS\nData box ID:\nf5vj9hu\nAccessibility Statement\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0"
